  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN Parliamentarians for Human Rights (APHR) 2019-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to ASEAN Parliamentarians for Human Rights (APHR) 2019-2021.The planned effects of the project are better empowerment of Parliamentarians of ASEAN countries, supported by APHR, in contributing to the advancement of democracy, human rights, and equitable and sustainable development in the ASEAN region in the next five years (2019-2023).</narrative>
  </description>
